{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Runemaster Magebreaker: Hurricane strikes weaken magic and dispel a harmful magic effect (#1286)",
  "contract": [
    "Magebreaker 804061 (Riftblade talent, CharacterAdvancement 6481) reads 'Dealing damage with Hurricane now also",
    "reduces the targets Magic damage dealt by $704430s3% for $704430d and dispels 1 harmful magic effect from you",
    "with each strike.' Its only effect is aura 42 naming 704430, but Spell.dbc gives it ProcFlags 0 and no",
    "spell_proc row existed, so it never fired. 704430: effect 0 SPELL_EFFECT_DISPEL MiscValue 1 (magic) on the",
    "caster, BasePoints 0 + DieSides 1 = one aura; effect 2 SPELL_AURA_MOD_DAMAGE_PERCENT_DONE (79) BasePoints -16 + 1",
    "= -15 for MiscValue 126 (all magic schools) on the enemy; SpellDuration 31 = 8000 ms. Hurricane 645435 strikes",
    "through 645437, a triggered melee-class spell and the only family 38 record with SpellFamilyFlags word 2 0x4.",
    "Expected: with the talent every landed strike casts 704430 (one proc per strike), the target carries the -15",
    "magic damage done debuff for 8 sec and the Runemaster's harmful magic effect (Faerie Fire 770, Dispel 1) is",
    "removed; without the talent the same Hurricane leaves neither."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 120000,
  "players": [
    {"id": "rm", "race": 1, "class": 32, "level": 80, "melee_hit_rating": 10000, "expertise_rating": 10000,
      "spell_hit_rating": 10000}
  ],
  "creatures": [
    {"id": "enemy", "owner": "rm", "entry": 36, "level": 80, "health": 1000000, "distance": 3}
  ],
  "steps": [
